F000:925B                              db  FF FF 7C 87 88 1B FF 00 FF FF FF 1E FF FF FF FF ; ..|.............
F000:926B                              db  1F FF 7F 94 11 17 05 12 14 19 15 09 0F 10 1B 1D ; ................
