rom_option_flags:
        ; Build-time option bytes: AF45=0Eh (bit1 halt on fatal, bit2, bit3 128 KB granularity), AF46=0Bh (bit0 CPU speed from CMOS, bit1 40:15 preset, bit3 display/CMOS 1Fh gating), AF47=E0h (bit7 alternate A20 method, bits 5-6), AF55=25h (bit0 speed-change click, bit2, bit5), AF56/AF57/AF58 = 48h/50h/50h hot-key scancodes (Up/Down arrows with Ctrl+Alt) for the CPU speed keys, AF59=02h floppy speed byte, AF5A=64h, AF5D/AF5E/AF5F = 02h/01h/00h the three CPU speed values written to chipset reg 300h.
